# Shopping Management System

## Introduction

Shopping Management System is a Java Core console application used to manage shopping items.

The program allows users to:

- Add new shopping items
- Display all shopping items
- Update item information
- Delete items
- Search items by id or name
- Sort items by name

The project applies Object-Oriented Programming (OOP), ArrayList collection, validation, exception handling, and menu-driven programming.

---

# Technologies Used

- Java SE
- IntelliJ IDEA
- ArrayList
- OOP Concepts

